The identity uses the approved paired-frame symbol with a Geist SemiBold wordmark. Violet **#605DEB** and lavender **#AAA8FF** identify the brand; ink, dark and paper provide the working surfaces. The two open frames and the space between them stay consistent across the app icon, navigation, sign-in screen, landing page and report signature.

I carried the rebrand into the product experience as well as the artwork: a recognisable workspace, clearer navigation, a landing page that demonstrates the review process, and reports that look ready for a client conversation.
